OL,3,ASpanish pensioner whose eviction
OL,4,Asparked nationwide protests dies, union
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn elderly woman whose eviction sparked
OL,8,Fnationwide protests over Spain's
OL,9,Fhousing crisis and a political row that
OL,10,Ftriggered early elections has died,
OL,11,Faccording to Madrid's tenants union.
OL,13,FMaricarmen Abascal, 87, was forcibly
OL,14,Fremoved on a stretcher from her
OL,15,Fapartment of more than 70 years on 23
OL,16,FSeptember after she was unable to
OL,17,Fafford rent increases.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
