OL,3,AIsraelis mourn 7 October attack victims
OL,4,Athree years after deadly Hamas raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the attack, Israel
OL,7,Flaunched a military offensive in Gaza
OL,8,Fwhich has killed more than 74,200
OL,9,Fpeople, according to the Hamas-run
OL,10,Fhealth ministry, whose figures are seen
OL,11,Fas reliable by the UN.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
